ting and a refreshed look across all environments. Shadows are now supported on Quest 3/3s, adding more depth and realism to every match.\n\n\ud83d\udcc8 Improvements\nEnhanced lighting for more dynamic and realistic courts\nAdded shadows on Quest 3 / 3S devices\nComplete visual facelift across all environments\nDynamic grip detection for more consistent correct racket rotations on forehand and backhand\nAdjust ball toss speed for controller \nTweak automatic recovery position\nTweak outgoing ball spin and ball speed\n\n\ud83c\udfaf Bug Fixes\nVarious stability and visual improvements\nPerformance optimization\nFix exploit on serve\n\nStep on court and experience the upgrade yourself. \ud83c\udfbe\n Your Tennis Esports Team", "created_date": 1777315926, "id": "26228211910213133", "version": "2026.4.0.3", "version_code": 604272040, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4872542182873415", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26228211910213133"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "553256016211576"}]}, "change_log": "\ud83d\udd04\ud83c\udfbe\u2728 Welcome to v2026.4.0.2 The Graphics Overhaul\nThis update brings a full visual overhaul with enhanced lighting and a refreshed look across all environments. Shadows are now supported on Quest 3/3s, adding more depth and realism to every match.\n\n\ud83d\udcc8 Improvements\nEnhanced lighting for more dynamic and realistic courts\nAdded shadows on Quest 3 / 3S devices\nComplete visual facelift across all environments\nDynamic grip detection for more consistent correct racket rotations on forehand and backhand\nAdjust